    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_steelbb_16",
      "hash64": "7B3049B0CD503443",
      "text": "这是战胜纳莉我的纪念。\\n开始拍照吧。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_steelbb_17",
      "hash64": "7B3048B0CD503290",
      "text": "接下来，\\n纳莉我的招式也传让给你。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
